title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/rally.jpg

= Political Rally

Mass rallies are a common feature of social democratic life, especially in the lead-up to an election. What is the primary theme of this rally?

- @class_struggle: The class struggle of the proletariat against the bourgeoisie.
- @welfare: The maintenance and expansion of social welfare programs to combat post-partition struggles.
- @democracy: Defending democracy and the republic against authoritarian dictatorships.
- @pacifism: Opposing war, nationalism, and militarism at all costs.
- @nationalism: Defending polish sovereignty and national identity.
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: workers_pps += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_pps += 4*(1-dissent) if internationalist_strength > nationalist_strength; workers_pps += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_pps += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; internationalist_strength += 5; internationalist_dissent -= 5; bourgeoisie_pps -= 3; petit_pps -= 2;

Our message of class struggle appeals to the left wing of the working class, while potentially alienating the middle class. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our achievements in nationalization have assisted our messaging. ?]

@welfare
on-arrival: workers_pps += 4*(1-dissent); workers_pps += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_pps += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_pps += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 1; center_strength += 3; center_dissent -= 3; internationalist_dissent -= 3;

The maintenance and expansion of social welfare programs appeals to the organized workers, whose benefits are the accomplishments of social democracy. [? if welfare > 1 : Our achievements in expanding welfare have made this message more effective. ?]

@democracy
on-arrival: democratization += 1; pro_republic += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_pps += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; unemployed_pps += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; pro_republic += 4*(1 - dissent) if democratization >= 3; petit_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; center_strength += 3

Our speakers defend the republican system and rail against the monarchists and authoritarians who threaten it.

[? if democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite the workers as much as more practical issues. But that may change; part of our job is to provide political education to the proletariat. ?]
[? if democratization >= 3 : Since we have consistently made democratization a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1.5; pps_nationalism -= 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); workers_pps += 4*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; unemployed_pps += 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; petit_pps += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; internationalist_strength -= 5; internationalist_dissent -= 5; nationalist_dissent += 5

Our speakers denounce the military establishment and all the spending entering that black hole. Some adventurous speakers question the responsibility of the military elites in organizing the Great War.

[? if pacifism < 3 : Given the volume of nationalist indoctrination in our society, it is difficult to argue so vehemently against the military. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made pacifism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@nationalism
on-arrival: pps_nationalism += 1.5; pacifism -= 1; nationalism += 3*(1 - dissent); workers_pps += 4*(1 - dissent) if nationalism >= 3; unemployed_pps += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalism >= 3; nationalism += 5*(1-dissent) if pps_nationalism >= 3; peasants_pps += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalist_strength -= 5; nationalist_dissent -= 5; internationalist_dissent += 5

Our speakers defends Polish sovereignty and emphasises the necessity of defense. Some adventurous speakers question the responsibility of the military elites in organizing the Great War.

[? if pps_nationalism < 3 : Given that our party have previously supported pacifism, it is difficult to argue for nationalism. ?]
[? if pps_nationalism >= 3 : Since we have consistently made nationalism a theme of our campaign, the workers are enthusiastic about our message. ?]

@local
on-arrival: workers_pps += 4*(1-dissent); peasants_pps += 2*(1-dissent); petit_pps += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_pps += 3*(1-dissent);

Our speakers have gauged the mood and are speaking to the issues that seem to most affect the workers in this moment.
